{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are an intelligent QA system. First think step-by-step, then provide the final answer.\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Janet's ducks lay 16 eggs per day.\nShe eats 3 for breakfast and bakes muffins with 4 each day.\nShe sells the remainder for $2 per egg. How much does she make per day?"}],"temperature":0.5,"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"chain_of_thought":{"type":"string"},"correct_answer":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["chain_of_thought","correct_answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}